{%- comment -%}
  PB collection grid (02 §2.2, §5.4–5.8; Archive-Collection, Archive-Collection-Mobile).
  Rendered by main-collection-product-grid inside #ProductGridContainer when its Archive layout is on, so
  Dawn's facets.js replaces it after each filter or sort change (#product-grid keeps data-id).
  - Results: a 3-up [2-up] grid of pb-product-card, 56/28 [28/12] gaps (assets/section-pb-collection.css).
  - The "New to brass?" promo tile (pb-collection-promo) after the products on the last page only. It isn't a
    product, so it's outside the product count and the pagination, and it never shows on an empty result.
  - No results (filters match nothing): the Archive empty state with "Reset filters" (pb.collection.empty_*).
  - Empty collection (no products at all): its own copy and a link home (pb.collection.empty_collection_*).

  Accepts:
  - results: {Object} The collection
  - paginate: {Object} The paginate object
  - grid_settings: {Object} The grid section's settings

  Usage:
  {% render 'pb-collection-grid', results: collection, paginate: paginate, grid_settings: section.settings %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if results.products.size == 0 -%}
  <div class="collection collection--empty pb-collection page-width" id="product-grid" data-id="{{ section.id }}">
    <div class="loading-overlay gradient"></div>
    <div class="pb-empty">
      <span class="pb-diamond pb-empty__diamond" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      {%- if results.all_products_count > 0 -%}
        <h2 class="pb-empty__heading">{{ 'pb.collection.empty_heading' | t }}</h2>
        <p class="pb-empty__text">{{ 'pb.collection.empty_text' | t }}</p>
        <facet-remove class="pb-empty__action">
          <a href="{{ results.url }}" class="button button--secondary">{{ 'pb.collection.reset' | t }}</a>
        </facet-remove>
      {%- else -%}
        <h2 class="pb-empty__heading">{{ 'pb.collection.empty_collection_heading' | t }}</h2>
        <p class="pb-empty__text">{{ 'pb.collection.empty_collection_text' | t }}</p>
        <div class="pb-empty__action">
          <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}" class="button button--secondary">
            {{- 'pb.collection.empty_collection_link' | t -}}
          </a>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
{%- else -%}
  <div class="collection pb-collection page-width">
    <div class="loading-overlay gradient"></div>
    <ul
      id="product-grid"
      data-id="{{ section.id }}"
      class="pb-grid"
      role="list"
      style="--pb-grid-columns: {{ grid_settings.columns_desktop }}; --pb-grid-columns-mobile: {{ grid_settings.columns_mobile }};"
    >
      {%- for product in results.products -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign lazy_load = true
          if forloop.index <= grid_settings.columns_desktop
            assign lazy_load = false
          endif
        -%}
        <li class="pb-grid__item">
          {% render 'pb-product-card',
            card_product: product,
            show_secondary_image: grid_settings.show_secondary_image,
            lazy_load: lazy_load,
            product_view_context: 'collection'
          %}
        </li>
      {%- endfor -%}
      {%- if grid_settings.pb_promo_enable and paginate.next == nil -%}
        {% render 'pb-collection-promo', promo: grid_settings %}
      {%- endif -%}
    </ul>

    {%- if paginate.pages > 1 -%}
      {% render 'pagination', paginate: paginate, anchor: '' %}
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
